  <description akvo:type="4" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extension TREE Project</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From 2018 until 2022, VNG International has supported 33 MMDAs in the improvement of their local taxation processes with the TREE project. This project has formally come to an end on the 31st of March 2022. In cooperation with the Dutch embassy in Accra and the Dutch MFA, VNG International has supported the particpating MMDAs until the 31st of December 2022 in a transition project under the SDLG partnership. 

The TREE transition project under SDLG had the following objectives:

1. To continue basic support to MMDAs on their revenue process during 2022

2. To facilitate a handover of project results to a Ghanaian counterpart

&#x200b;

&#x200b;</narrative>
  </description>
